# Gradle
.gradle/
build/
# `build/` matches a directory of that name at ANY depth, which also swallows the
# `com.github.oinsio.gnomish.build` source package holding build-logic's shared
# services and value sources — new files there would be silently untracked.
!build-logic/src/main/groovy/com/github/oinsio/gnomish/build/
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar

